  "_readme": [
    "THE ONLY PLACE PRICES, DATES AND AVAILABILITY ARE DEFINED.",
    "Both booking pages read it. Both Stripe charges are priced from it.",
    "",
    "SHAPE",
    "  products.<name>.defaults   base price, tiers, options, deposit rule",
    "  products.<name>.editions   one block per date; 'prices' overrides the defaults",
    "",
    "TIERS are the mutually exclusive choice. For the weekend that is the room;",
    "for the week it is the package. Weekend tier prices ADD to the base.",
    "The week has base 0, so its tier price IS the package price.",
    "",
    "AN EDITION CAN RESTRICT TIERS with \"tiers\": [\"full\"]. That enforces the",
    "no-mixing rule: a Full Experience week cannot be sold a Classic place.",
    "",
    "'left' is places remaining. 0 shows as full and the server refuses the sale.",
    "It is manual — nothing decrements it on purchase. Buyers see it, so keep it true.",
    "",
    "Deploy after editing (wrangler deploy). This is a static asset."
  ],

